      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Priority (1-5, 5 first) only orders which\neligible job is picked next. A crashed\nworker's job returns to the queue when\nits claim expires; a per-job key makes\nthe repeat harmless.",
