      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A retry wait works the same way: it is stored as scheduled until start_after (the retry delay) passes.\nBatches: job_batches is only a parent row. Its children are ordinary jobs in the same queues; batch status and progress are computed from them on read.",
      "originalText": "A retry wait works the same way: it is stored as scheduled until start_after (the retry delay) passes.\nBatches: job_batches is only a parent row. Its children are ordinary jobs in the same queues; batch status and progress are computed from them on read.",
